      "settings": {
        "section_layout": "column",
        "subheading": "",
        "heading": "",
        "heading_size": "h3",
        "dot": true,
        "text": "<h2>1. Eco-Friendly Materials:</h2><p>We use organic cotton, bamboo fibers, and recycled materials in our bedsets, bedsheets, and mattresses, reducing the need for harmful chemicals and promoting sustainable farming practices.</p><h2>2. Ethical Manufacturing:</h2><p>We partner with manufacturers who share our commitment to fair labor practices and environmental responsibility. Our factories adhere to strict ethical guidelines to ensure fair wages and safe working conditions.</p><h2>3. Sustainable Packaging:</h2><p>No matter where you are, we’ve got you covered. We provide reliable nationwide shipping to deliver your new bed to cities and towns across the country. With partnerships with trusted logistics providers, we ensure your delivery is timely and secure.</p><h2>4. Durability & Longevity:</h2><p>We prioritize high-quality, durable products that last longer, reducing the need for frequent replacements and minimizing waste.</p><p>By integrating these key sustainable practices into our operations, we ensure that every Leysara product reflects our dedication to both quality and the environment. We believe that true luxury lies in creating products that support a healthier, more sustainable world for future generations.</p>",
        "margin_top": "s",
        "margin_bottom": "s"
