    "rich_text_BbieRV": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "settings": {
        "section_layout": "column",
        "subheading": "",
        "heading": "",
        "heading_size": "h3",
        "dot": true,
        "text": "<h2>1. Durability:</h2><p>We use only the finest materials that are carefully selected for their strength and longevity. Whether it’s a mattress designed for consistent support or bed linens made to withstand multiple washes, our products are crafted to last. This durability ensures that your investment in Leysara products will stand the test of time, providing you with years of reliable comfort.</p><h2>2. Comfort:</h2><p>The core of our promise is to enhance your sleep experience. We understand the importance of comfort, and every product we offer is designed with your relaxation in mind. From the softness of our bed linens to the perfect firmness of our mattresses, we prioritize your well-being so you can enjoy a truly restful night’s sleep.</p><h2>3. Premium Materials:</h2><p>Only the best materials make it into our products. We carefully select high-quality fabrics and components such as organic cotton, premium memory foam, and sustainably sourced wool to ensure that our bedsets, bedsheets, and mattresses provide a superior sleeping experience. Each fabric is chosen for its breathability, softness, and ability to retain its quality over time.</p><h2>4. Safety & Certification:</h2><p>All of our products undergo rigorous testing to meet the highest safety and quality standards. We are committed to offering you peace of mind, knowing that our products are free from harmful chemicals and meet certifications such as OEKO-TEX® Standard 100, which ensures that all textiles used are safe for skin contact.</p><h2>5. Craftsmanship:</h2><p>Our products are crafted with care and precision by skilled artisans who take pride in their work. From the stitching of our bed linens to the construction of our mattresses, each product is carefully made to ensure it meets our exacting standards of quality.</p><h2>6. Consistency:</h2><p>We guarantee that every product that leaves our workshop is consistent in quality. Whether you’re purchasing a mattress or a set of sheets, you can trust that each item has been made with the same attention to detail and commitment to excellence, ensuring a uniform and dependable experience across our entire range.</p><h2>7. Innovative Design:</h2><p>Our products are designed not only for comfort but also for function and aesthetic appeal. We combine innovative design with traditional craftsmanship to create bedsets, sheets, and mattresses that not only feel amazing but also look beautiful in your home.</p><p>At Leysara, our quality promise is more than just words—it’s our commitment to delivering the finest, most comfortable, and longest-lasting products for your sleep. We want every night to be a peaceful, rejuvenating experience, and we stand by our promise to provide only the best.</p>",
        "margin_top": "s",
        "margin_bottom": "s"
      }
    },
